            <div xml:id="d114">

                <pb facs="0148" n="78" sameAs="frus:frus1934v04/pg78"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/4086: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gibson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-09-06T17:00:00-03:00">September 6, 1934—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 6—4:42 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>208. Reference paragraph 2 my 207, September 5, 6 p.m.<anchor n="53"
                        xml:id="d114-f1"/> Foreign Office has instructed Bolivian [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Brazilian?</hi>] Minister in La Paz to advise Bolivian
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs that in view of the fact that Brazil is not a
                    member of the League it will not accept position on any League committee such as
                    suggested by Bolivia. Repeated to Buenos Aires.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gibson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
